sequenceDiagram
  actor C as HTTP client
  participant W as UserController
  participant U as RegisterUserUseCase
  participant D as Domain rules (Email, Phone, User, PasswordPolicy)
  participant R as UserRepository (UserPersistenceAdapter)
  participant H as PasswordHasher (BCryptPasswordHasher)
  participant T as TokenIssuer (JjwtTokenIssuer)
  participant E as GlobalExceptionHandler

  C->>W: POST /api/v1/users (JSON)
  Note over W: strict binding, a syntax or type error is a 400
  W->>U: register(command)
  Note over U: transaction begins
  U->>D: collect the violations of every field
  alt any field breaks a rule
    D-->>U: reasons
    U-->>E: InvalidUserDataException
    E-->>C: 400 mensaje = the messages of the broken fields, sorted and joined
  end
  U->>R: existsByEmail(email)
  alt email already registered
    R-->>U: true
    U-->>E: EmailAlreadyRegisteredException
    E-->>C: 409 mensaje = El correo ya registrado
  end
  U->>H: hash(password)
  H-->>U: BCrypt hash
  Note over U: clock read once, truncated to microseconds
  U->>T: issue(id, email, now)
  T-->>U: signed token
  U->>D: User.registration()...build()
  D-->>U: User
  U->>R: save(user)
  Note over R: saveAndFlush, a unique violation is a 409
  R-->>U: saved
  Note over U: transaction commits
  U-->>W: User
  W-->>C: 201 UserResponse (never the password)
